            <ArticleTitle>A double-blind comparison of meptazinol with pentazocine and placebo in cancer pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>76-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Two consecutive double-blind, crossover, single-administration trials have shown that intramuscular meptazinol, a new opioid-antagonist drug, is superior to placebo and equivalent ot pentazocine in relieving chronic pain due to cancer.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
